# ShopNest — Environment Variables
#
# GOOD NEWS: This project has NO required environment variables.
# It uses the free public Fake Store API (https://fakestoreapi.com)
# which requires no API key or authentication.
#
# Just deploy to Vercel and it works out of the box.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you later add a payment gateway (Stripe, Razorpay), add keys here:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
